[en.FOCUS_C12_PUBLIC_AFFAIRS_BUREAU]
Public Affairs Bureau

[en.FOCUS_C12_PUBLIC_AFFAIRS_BUREAU_desc]
Currently, the rock farm maintains communication with other pony gathering areas in the autonomous territory through temporary governmental agencies. We should take steps to formalize these institutions and transform them into a comprehensive large-scale organization to strengthen our control over these areas and implement decrees.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_PUBLIC_AFFAIRS_BUREAU]
公共事务局

[zh.FOCUS_C12_PUBLIC_AFFAIRS_BUREAU_desc]
目前采石农场通过临时的政府机关来跟自治领的其他小马聚集区保持联系，我们应该着蹄将这些机构正规化，转型成一个综合性的大型机构来加强我们对这些地区的管控并推行政令

